{"3605520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Digital Market Simulator", "steam_appid": 3605520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, Manage, and Grow Your Own Gaming Store!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Digital Market Simulator</i>, where you take charge of your own gaming store, sell video games and gaming-related products, and expand your business! Manage your inventory, design your store, and maximize profits as you create the ultimate shopping experience for gamers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Run Your Own Store</strong> – Sell video games, consoles, and accessories while managing your stock and pricing strategy.<br>🌙 <strong>Day-Night Cycle &amp; Home Life</strong> – Work during the day, then head home to rest and prepare for the next business day.<br>🛒 <strong>Showcase &amp; Sell Products</strong> – Display your items on shelves and attract customers.<br>🔨 <strong>Customizable Store Design</strong> – Paint your store’s floors and walls to create your unique space.<br>🚀 <strong>Ever-Evolving Gameplay</strong> – A deep and dynamic system that continues to expand with new features and improvements.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to build the ultimate gaming store? Start your journey in <i>Digital Market Simulator</i> today!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Store As You Wish</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/02310ecfc7f1f90b9e8176ab6f0892ad.poster.avif?t=1777749483\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/02310ecfc7f1f90b9e8176ab6f0892ad.webm?t=1777749483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://s